1
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:14,119
Cheng An

2
00:00:14,839 --> 00:00:16,160
Give me a baby.

3
00:00:16,679 --> 00:00:18,239
I have to get pregnant

4
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:21,399
so I can get everything I want.

5
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:26,440
This tie of yours...

6
00:00:27,359 --> 00:00:28,679
I really like it.

7
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:34,679
Recently,

8
00:00:34,679 --> 00:00:36,920
Chairman of renowned Valley Breeze Group,

9
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,079
Cheng Feng, has passed away.

10
00:00:38,079 --> 00:00:39,439
The funeral will be held today.

11
00:00:39,439 --> 00:00:41,719
The family estate division is in focus.

12
00:00:42,799 --> 00:00:43,960
Why haven't the eldest brother's wife

13
00:00:44,039 --> 00:00:45,320
and the third brother arrived yet?

14
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:46,920
It's such a major event,

15
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:48,359
yet they don't even care.

16
00:00:55,479 --> 00:00:57,799
They're likely exhausted from being busy.

17
00:00:58,359 --> 00:00:59,920
They must be resting somewhere.

18
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:06,120
I'll go look for them.

19
00:01:09,239 --> 00:01:10,920
The eldest brother just died,

20
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:13,480
Second Brother dotes on Sister-in-law.

21
00:01:13,480 --> 00:01:14,640
Stop talking nonsense.

22
00:01:42,719 --> 00:01:43,519
Now

23
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:45,400
I belong only to you.

24
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:58,840
Cheng An, Lin Wanmei.

25
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:01,079
Long time no see.

26
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:03,359
I'm back.

27
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,079
You scared me.

28
00:04:32,639 --> 00:04:33,680
Why are you here?

29
00:04:34,959 --> 00:04:35,759
Taking a break.

30
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:37,279
What's wrong?

31
00:04:37,439 --> 00:04:38,240
Look.

32
00:04:38,879 --> 00:04:40,079
Big brother is dead.

33
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,839
I'll lay my cards on the table.

34
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:45,279
The Valley Breeze Chairman position...

35
00:04:45,279 --> 00:04:46,040
is yours.

36
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:48,439
I...

37
00:04:48,439 --> 00:04:49,560
I must have it.

38
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:55,399
Old Madam,

39
00:04:55,839 --> 00:04:57,800
it's inappropriate to bring this up today.

40
00:04:57,879 --> 00:04:58,560
But...

41
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:00,360
since Chairman Cheng passed away,

42
00:05:00,639 --> 00:05:02,319
Valley Breeze has been leaderless.

43
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:03,759
While everyone is here,

44
00:05:03,959 --> 00:05:04,759
I suggest

45
00:05:04,759 --> 00:05:05,680
right here,

46
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:08,319
we discuss the next Chairman candidate.

47
00:05:08,959 --> 00:05:10,439
I will have Cheng Yan

48
00:05:10,519 --> 00:05:11,959
take over his brother's position.

49
00:05:12,399 --> 00:05:13,319
Mom.

50
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:15,079
Are you crazy?

51
00:05:15,279 --> 00:05:17,560
Cheng Yan is just an idle loser.

52
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:19,600
How can he handle such a large business?

53
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:20,319
Cheng Ruolin,

54
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:22,399
I call you big sister,

55
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:23,399
so what?

56
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,399
You want to hit me?

57
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:26,279
Come on!

58
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,040
Hit me!

59
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:27,959
Enough!

60
00:05:28,439 --> 00:05:29,240
Mom,

61
00:05:29,839 --> 00:05:31,120
regarding the successor,

62
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:33,720
Brother Feng has already arranged it.

63
00:05:34,879 --> 00:05:35,680
Sister-in-law,

64
00:05:36,279 --> 00:05:37,720
Big brother is dead.

65
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,199
How could he make arrangements for you?

66
00:05:39,319 --> 00:05:41,040
Why even call her Sister-in-law?

67
00:05:41,759 --> 00:05:43,480
Now that Big brother is gone,

68
00:05:44,319 --> 00:05:45,759
she's just an outsider.

69
00:05:46,319 --> 00:05:47,920
She should go where she belongs.

70
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:56,759
The will states clearly,

71
00:05:57,920 --> 00:06:00,160
Brother Feng left his property and shares

72
00:06:00,639 --> 00:06:02,399
to his child.

73
00:06:03,079 --> 00:06:03,879
And I...

74
00:06:04,839 --> 00:06:06,160
am pregnant.

75
00:06:08,319 --> 00:06:09,600
Brother Feng's only flesh and blood.

76
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:13,439
There's been no news for so many years.

77
00:06:13,759 --> 00:06:15,079
And now you're pregnant?

78
00:06:15,079 --> 00:06:15,879
Yes.

79
00:06:16,319 --> 00:06:18,680
This child is destined for hardship.

80
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:22,000
He will never see his father.

81
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:25,120
But as his mother,

82
00:06:26,759 --> 00:06:28,680
I will definitely protect what is his,

83
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:29,800
his share of the family estate.

84
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:33,800
Mom,

85
00:06:34,399 --> 00:06:35,680
don't be foolish.

86
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:38,279
Who knows if this child will even be born.

87
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:40,319
Whether it will be born is uncertain,

88
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:41,680
but the child she's carrying...

89
00:06:41,839 --> 00:06:44,360
isn't Mr. Cheng's only flesh and blood.

90
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,360
Who is this person?

91
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:46,560
Who is she?

92
00:06:46,639 --> 00:06:47,639
What is she here for?

93
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:57,759
Why use a red umbrella at a funeral?

94
00:06:57,879 --> 00:06:58,879
Exactly.

95
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,360
Cheng An.

96
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:10,360
Lin Wanmei.

97
00:07:10,639 --> 00:07:11,639
Three years ago,

98
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:13,600
at the Wine Competition in Korea,

99
00:07:13,879 --> 00:07:16,120
you poisoned my entry,

100
00:07:16,399 --> 00:07:18,120
pinned the blame on me,

101
00:07:18,279 --> 00:07:20,000
and sent me to prison.

102
00:07:20,279 --> 00:07:21,639
You had my face ruined

103
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,240
and my hand broken.

104
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:27,319
You thought I would die in there.

105
00:07:29,519 --> 00:07:30,759
But now...

106
00:07:31,439 --> 00:07:33,759
I've crawled out of hell.

107
00:07:34,959 --> 00:07:36,199
It's time to pay back

108
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:39,399
what you owe me.

109
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:40,959
Director Cheng,

110
00:07:46,639 --> 00:07:47,959
he will have news soon.

111
00:07:55,199 --> 00:07:56,639
Let me formally introduce myself.

112
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,720
My name is Sang Luo.

113
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:00,639
My mother is Sang Hui.

114
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:02,160
My father is Cheng Feng.

115
00:08:09,199 --> 00:08:10,319
Is it that sudden?

116
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:12,000
Aunt Lin?

117
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:14,639
We met a long time ago.

118
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:17,079
Though you and Brother Feng parted ways,

119
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:19,480
this is still his child after all.

120
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,199
Take this money for now.

121
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:22,879
Once the child is cured,

122
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:24,560
you must come back and let us know.

123
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:28,959
Miss Lin,

124
00:08:29,199 --> 00:08:30,600
this isn't about money.

125
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:31,959
Go tell Cheng Feng

126
00:08:31,959 --> 00:08:33,200
to see me just once.

127
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:34,759
Miss Sang,

128
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:37,039
Hurry and take your child for treatment.

129
00:08:38,399 --> 00:08:39,960
When my mother brought me to visit,

130
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,440
we met Aunt Lin.

131
00:08:41,679 --> 00:08:42,840
But unfortunately,

132
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:45,559
we couldn't meet the rest of the family.

133
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,679
My mother didn't want to intrude,

134
00:08:47,799 --> 00:08:49,639
so she took me and left this city.

135
00:08:50,159 --> 00:08:51,840
But now I'm back.

136
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:53,200
Feng

137
00:08:53,279 --> 00:08:55,159
never had a child in all those years,

138
00:08:56,159 --> 00:08:57,240
but now that he's gone,

139
00:08:57,440 --> 00:08:59,000
things are suddenly getting lively.

140
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:01,039
Indeed.

141
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:03,120
All kinds of riffraff

142
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:05,039
want to get a piece of the pie.

143
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:11,639
I presume my father...

144
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:12,720
No,

145
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:16,519
Mr. Cheng must have left behind belongings

146
00:09:16,519 --> 00:09:18,159
that can be used for a DNA test, right?

147
00:09:21,759 --> 00:09:23,200
As for the candidate for Chairman,

148
00:09:23,559 --> 00:09:26,039
we'll wait until the DNA results are out

149
00:09:26,639 --> 00:09:27,440
before discussing it further.

150
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:29,159
Cheng An.

151
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:30,399
Lin Wanmei.

152
00:09:30,919 --> 00:09:31,720
Three years ago,

153
00:09:32,519 --> 00:09:34,720
you chose a path for me.

154
00:09:35,679 --> 00:09:36,480
Three years later,

155
00:09:37,559 --> 00:09:40,120
I've already chosen the ending for you.

156
00:09:53,279 --> 00:09:54,559
Buy me a drink.

157
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:56,039
Little Uncle.

158
00:09:58,120 --> 00:09:59,000
Miss Sang,

159
00:10:00,279 --> 00:10:01,519
the results aren't out yet.

160
00:10:02,440 --> 00:10:03,960
Better not claim relatives so casually.

161
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:05,720
Even though the results aren't out,

162
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:07,840
the moment I saw you, Little Uncle,

163
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:09,080
you looked familiar.

164
00:10:09,799 --> 00:10:11,879
Like we've known each other for years.

165
00:10:12,279 --> 00:10:14,519
So I came to acknowledge you first.

166
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:17,279
Little Uncle,

167
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:19,480
tell me, if someone

168
00:10:19,759 --> 00:10:22,159
just attended their own brother's funeral,

169
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:24,200
and comes to a bar for fun that night,

170
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:25,840
what kind of mindset is that?

171
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:27,039
If you ask me,

172
00:10:27,879 --> 00:10:29,120
with the older brother dead,

173
00:10:29,799 --> 00:10:31,360
the younger brother is thrilled.

174
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:34,360
After all, the brother left no heirs.

175
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:37,360
All the property will be his.

176
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:39,519
Who cares about brotherly love?

177
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:42,159
Right.

178
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:43,879
Then tell me,

179
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:45,679
the woman the brother left behind...

180
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:47,080
can the younger brother have her too?

181
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,000
Miss Sang.

182
00:10:51,919 --> 00:10:52,879
Jokes like this

183
00:10:53,120 --> 00:10:54,039
should not be made.

184
00:10:59,919 --> 00:11:01,519
When you get angry, Little Uncle,

185
00:11:01,519 --> 00:11:03,000
you're really charming.

186
00:11:07,679 --> 00:11:09,519
You just can't take a joke.

187
00:11:09,799 --> 00:11:10,960
So petty.

188
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:18,440
This liquor is so strong,

189
00:11:19,759 --> 00:11:20,840
it doesn't suit me.

190
00:11:25,039 --> 00:11:26,039
Little Uncle,

191
00:11:26,559 --> 00:11:28,559
we'll be seeing each other often.

192
00:11:29,679 --> 00:11:31,279
I hope you, Little Uncle,

193
00:11:31,279 --> 00:11:33,440
welcome me into your world.

194
00:11:43,039 --> 00:11:43,879
Who is she?

195
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:45,639
A rose.

196
00:11:46,519 --> 00:11:48,399
A wild rose with thorns.

197
00:11:52,399 --> 00:11:53,440
Did you see Cheng An?

198
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:56,000
I met the whole Cheng family.

199
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:58,279
How did it feel?

200
00:12:01,080 --> 00:12:01,879
Hatred.

201
00:12:04,639 --> 00:12:05,639
And towards Cheng An?

202
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:09,200
Is it hatred too?

203
00:12:16,759 --> 00:12:17,919
I'm just scared.

204
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:22,320
Scared of falling into a trap again.

205
00:12:25,240 --> 00:12:26,080
You don't have to be scared.

206
00:12:26,759 --> 00:12:28,080
I'll always be by your side.

207
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,720
Help you take back what you want.

208
00:12:31,399 --> 00:12:32,600
Thank you, Yi Kai.

209
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:34,639
If it weren't for you,

210
00:12:35,159 --> 00:12:36,440
I'd be dead already.

211
00:12:37,559 --> 00:12:39,320
So I owe you my life.

212
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:42,159
You need to keep your life safe.

213
00:12:43,399 --> 00:12:44,799
Fengtang's wine still depends on you.

214
00:12:47,399 --> 00:12:48,279
First victory.

215
00:12:48,519 --> 00:12:50,200
The first step of our plan succeeded.

216
00:12:54,279 --> 00:12:55,080
Very soon,

217
00:12:56,120 --> 00:12:57,600
you'll be entering the Cheng family.

218
00:12:58,399 --> 00:12:59,159
Yes.

219
00:13:00,600 --> 00:13:01,399
Very soon.

220
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:11,000
Mom,

221
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:13,320
you don't actually feel pity

222
00:13:13,320 --> 00:13:14,320
for that wild girl today, do you?

223
00:13:14,639 --> 00:13:15,639
And that Lin Wanmei...

224
00:13:15,679 --> 00:13:16,600
That's also ridiculous.

225
00:13:16,639 --> 00:13:18,000
Big brother dies and she gets pregnant.

226
00:13:18,279 --> 00:13:19,559
What nonsense are you spouting?

227
00:13:20,559 --> 00:13:22,320
You're my biological son.

228
00:13:22,879 --> 00:13:23,840
Valley Breeze Group

229
00:13:24,440 --> 00:13:26,559
will naturally be inherited by you.

230
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:27,759
When things happen,

231
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:29,519
don't panic so much.

232
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:31,480
Queen Mother,

233
00:13:31,519 --> 00:13:33,320
how can I not panic?

234
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:35,480
Lin Wanmei is closing in from the front,

235
00:13:35,559 --> 00:13:37,080
and Cheng An watches covetously behind.

236
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:37,960
Now a wild girl has shown up.

237
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:38,679
Mom,

238
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:40,120
you've been busy all day.

239
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:41,240
Let me wash your feet.

240
00:13:46,360 --> 00:13:48,080
Sister-in-law is still so filial.

241
00:13:50,360 --> 00:13:51,159
Mom.

242
00:13:51,320 --> 00:13:53,120
Don't forget what you promised me.

243
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:57,320
Here, Mom.

244
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:01,480
How's the water temperature?

245
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:04,639
Now that

246
00:14:04,679 --> 00:14:05,559
my eldest son is gone

247
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:07,320
and you're pregnant,

248
00:14:07,879 --> 00:14:08,919
as for that girl,

249
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:10,480
we don't know the results yet.

250
00:14:10,840 --> 00:14:12,759
She just looks a bit like my eldest.

251
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:15,919
The company shares must be redistributed.

252
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:17,799
The position of Chairman

253
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:19,399
must also be decided.

254
00:14:20,399 --> 00:14:21,559
Who do you think

255
00:14:21,559 --> 00:14:23,080
is more suitable?

256
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:28,480
As for the position of Chairman,

257
00:14:28,679 --> 00:14:29,960
I'll follow your arrangements, Mom.

258
00:14:47,559 --> 00:14:48,399
Lin Wanmei

259
00:14:50,679 --> 00:14:52,559
You really outdid yourself.

260
00:14:53,200 --> 00:14:54,919
Not a peep for so many years.

261
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:56,000
And right at the end,

262
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,600
you actually managed to get pregnant.

263
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:00,159
My big brother didn't have a single child.

264
00:15:00,519 --> 00:15:02,159
Now, suddenly there are two.

265
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:04,080
I suppose

266
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:06,720
you don't want that wild girl moving in.

267
00:15:07,279 --> 00:15:09,000
After all, if she comes in,

268
00:15:09,279 --> 00:15:11,480
she'll take a share of his inheritance.

269
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:12,960
What I want doesn't matter.

270
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:14,600
Brother Feng left a will.

271
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:16,679
Mom is perfectly capable of handling this.

272
00:15:16,919 --> 00:15:18,000
I'll follow the law

273
00:15:18,120 --> 00:15:19,200
and Mom's arrangements.

274
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:21,519
Don't pretend to be so calm and composed.

275
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:23,840
At the Wine Competition back then,

276
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:25,559
what was that bartender's name again?

277
00:15:26,879 --> 00:15:27,879
Ye Xiaowei.

278
00:15:28,360 --> 00:15:30,159
You were truly ruthless.

279
00:15:30,360 --> 00:15:31,840
A living, breathing person,

280
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:33,639
just vanished into thin air.

281
00:15:37,399 --> 00:15:39,320
If Sang Luo's DNA test proves

282
00:15:39,320 --> 00:15:40,679
she is Brother Feng's daughter,

283
00:15:40,840 --> 00:15:43,279
then she gets a share of his inheritance.

284
00:15:43,840 --> 00:15:45,879
If she isn't Brother Feng's daughter...

285
00:15:47,279 --> 00:15:48,799
I'm not calm and composed.

286
00:15:49,399 --> 00:15:50,480
I accept my fate.

287
00:15:51,840 --> 00:15:52,840
Right.

288
00:15:54,039 --> 00:15:56,279
If we can prove she's a bastard,

289
00:15:56,639 --> 00:15:58,039
she won't get any inheritance.

290
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:04,679
As for the one in your belly,

291
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:07,879
could it be a bastard too?

292
00:16:08,919 --> 00:16:09,720
You!

293
00:16:10,120 --> 00:16:11,440
You can be careless with food,

294
00:16:11,480 --> 00:16:12,679
but careless words

295
00:16:12,679 --> 00:16:14,039
can kill.

296
00:16:14,840 --> 00:16:15,639
Ruolin,

297
00:16:16,399 --> 00:16:18,320
Brother Feng treated you well when alive.

298
00:16:18,679 --> 00:16:20,639
Even when he knew you embezzled funds,

299
00:16:20,639 --> 00:16:22,720
he paid out of pocket to cover for you.

300
00:16:23,279 --> 00:16:24,240
But if

301
00:16:24,320 --> 00:16:25,840
Mom finds out about this,

302
00:16:26,240 --> 00:16:28,720
would Valley Breeze Group still keep you?

303
00:16:30,960 --> 00:16:32,320
You know everything.

304
00:16:32,799 --> 00:16:33,600
Wanmei,

305
00:16:34,120 --> 00:16:35,879
where is my Calming incense?

306
00:16:36,039 --> 00:16:37,080
Coming, Mom!

307
00:16:40,080 --> 00:16:40,879
Ruolin.

308
00:16:42,039 --> 00:16:44,039
As long as you treat me as Sister-in-law,

309
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:46,840
I'll still treat you like my own sister.

310
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:56,320
I dreamt of my eldest son last night.

311
00:16:56,679 --> 00:16:57,720
It breaks my heart.

312
00:16:59,759 --> 00:17:01,799
Ancestors of the Cheng family above,

313
00:17:02,840 --> 00:17:04,039
my son Cheng Feng

314
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:06,480
has ascended to heaven.

315
00:17:07,079 --> 00:17:08,759
May the Ancestors guide him

316
00:17:09,279 --> 00:17:11,200
to the Western Paradise.

317
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:35,599
We still need to go to the Main Hall

318
00:17:35,759 --> 00:17:37,039
to offer another stick of incense.

319
00:17:37,039 --> 00:17:37,720
Mom.

320
00:17:37,759 --> 00:17:38,960
He's already in the ground.

321
00:17:38,960 --> 00:17:40,400
What's the point of doing all this?

322
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:41,799
In front of our Ancestors,

323
00:17:42,240 --> 00:17:43,400
watch your mouth!

324
00:17:43,799 --> 00:17:44,599
Mom,

325
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:46,559
Big brother is already gone.

326
00:17:46,559 --> 00:17:48,079
He can't see all these rituals.

327
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:50,200
In our Cheng family,

328
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:51,640
we all know each other's true colors.

329
00:17:52,359 --> 00:17:53,839
Besides, Dad is watching from up there.

330
00:17:54,559 --> 00:17:55,880
As for who wronged whom,

331
00:17:56,759 --> 00:17:57,759
don't we all know it deep down?

332
00:17:58,000 --> 00:17:58,799
Cheng Yan!

333
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:01,480
Have you forgotten the Cheng family code?

334
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:02,799
Don't wash your

335
00:18:02,839 --> 00:18:03,839
dirty linen in public!

336
00:18:04,160 --> 00:18:06,240
I don't want to talk nonsense to wood.

337
00:18:06,839 --> 00:18:07,960
Go by yourself if you want to.

338
00:18:17,839 --> 00:18:18,960
Who is that girl?

339
00:18:19,640 --> 00:18:21,559
She really is a devoted daughter.

340
00:18:22,119 --> 00:18:23,039
For the past few days,

341
00:18:23,039 --> 00:18:25,519
she chants scriptures for blessings daily.

342
00:18:26,079 --> 00:18:27,200
Is that so?

343
00:18:41,839 --> 00:18:42,720
Grandma.

344
00:18:48,519 --> 00:18:49,720
Hello, Old Madam Cheng.

345
00:18:50,880 --> 00:18:52,440
We don't even know whose bastard you are,

346
00:18:52,440 --> 00:18:54,000
yet you're so eager to suck up to us.

347
00:18:54,359 --> 00:18:55,799
Too bad my brother can't see this.

348
00:18:57,640 --> 00:18:59,240
Whether my father can see it or not,

349
00:18:59,559 --> 00:19:00,599
I don't care.

350
00:19:01,160 --> 00:19:02,839
I only seek peace of mind.

351
00:19:05,119 --> 00:19:05,920
Since

352
00:19:06,039 --> 00:19:07,359
you're this sincere,

353
00:19:07,960 --> 00:19:09,160
then you can join us.

354
00:19:24,079 --> 00:19:25,799
Isn't that the eldest brother's bastard?

355
00:19:26,240 --> 00:19:27,400
Why did you follow us here?

356
00:19:30,880 --> 00:19:31,680
Tonight,

357
00:19:32,200 --> 00:19:33,359
let's have dinner together.

358
00:19:34,559 --> 00:19:36,160
Thank you for the invite, Old Madam Cheng.

359
00:19:36,599 --> 00:19:38,799
But before the DNA results are out,

360
00:19:39,519 --> 00:19:41,519
I shouldn't claim ties with the Chengs.

361
00:19:44,839 --> 00:19:46,000
The wind is strong today.

362
00:19:46,480 --> 00:19:47,799
You should head back first, Old Madam.

363
00:19:54,039 --> 00:19:55,359
Watch out!

364
00:19:59,240 --> 00:20:00,559
Mom, are you okay?

365
00:20:00,640 --> 00:20:01,559
Are you okay, Mom?

366
00:20:01,720 --> 00:20:03,000
What could happen to me?

367
00:20:03,200 --> 00:20:03,920
Didn't you see

368
00:20:03,920 --> 00:20:05,160
that this girl shielded me?

369
00:20:05,559 --> 00:20:06,680
As long as you're okay, Old Madam.

370
00:20:07,160 --> 00:20:08,279
You're bleeding.

371
00:20:09,279 --> 00:20:10,279
Let me see what happened.

372
00:20:11,039 --> 00:20:11,799
I'm fine.

373
00:20:17,119 --> 00:20:18,880
What happened here?

374
00:20:22,559 --> 00:20:23,640
What happened?

375
00:20:27,240 --> 00:20:28,319
When I was little,

376
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:32,240
they said I was a fatherless wild child.

377
00:20:32,799 --> 00:20:35,319
They stomped on this finger and broke it.

378
00:20:42,400 --> 00:20:44,920
As long as your DNA results check out,

379
00:20:45,359 --> 00:20:47,880
you'll have a place in the Cheng family.

380
00:20:48,759 --> 00:20:50,359
Children of our Cheng family

381
00:20:51,079 --> 00:20:52,680
won't be bullied by anyone.

382
00:21:11,279 --> 00:21:12,119
Who exactly is she?

383
00:21:12,960 --> 00:21:15,319
Why do I think of Xiaowei when I see her?

384
00:21:17,039 --> 00:21:17,880
Third Brother.

385
00:21:18,160 --> 00:21:19,079
You stay behind.

386
00:21:19,319 --> 00:21:20,759
Chant scriptures for your eldest brother.

387
00:21:35,200 --> 00:21:35,960
What?

388
00:21:39,480 --> 00:21:40,359
You hurt your hand, right?

389
00:21:40,839 --> 00:21:41,720
I can't take you to the hospital.

390
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:43,359
Just patch it up for now.

391
00:22:10,359 --> 00:22:11,240
Which hand?

392
00:22:32,440 --> 00:22:33,319
You're quite skilled.

393
00:22:34,799 --> 00:22:36,319
Seems like a guilty conscience

394
00:22:36,519 --> 00:22:37,680
makes you worship here often.

395
00:22:37,960 --> 00:22:38,880
I don't have a guilty conscience.

396
00:22:39,839 --> 00:22:41,759
But I do often pray for an old friend.

397
00:22:43,519 --> 00:22:44,640
Which old friend?

398
00:22:47,359 --> 00:22:48,240
Done.

399
00:22:53,079 --> 00:22:53,960
Not even a thank you?

400
00:22:54,960 --> 00:22:55,839
Where are you going now?

401
00:23:00,839 --> 00:23:02,119
To chant scriptures.

402
00:23:02,119 --> 00:23:03,720
If you don't want to chant,

403
00:23:03,720 --> 00:23:04,960
you can leave anytime.

404
00:23:06,599 --> 00:23:07,400
Don't worry.

405
00:23:07,880 --> 00:23:09,279
I won't tell on you.

406
00:23:11,160 --> 00:23:12,720
My older brother treated me well.

407
00:23:13,039 --> 00:23:14,680
Chanting scriptures for him is my duty.

408
00:23:14,799 --> 00:23:15,599
As for you,

409
00:23:16,359 --> 00:23:17,200
if you want to leave,

410
00:23:17,200 --> 00:23:18,119
you can just go.

411
00:23:19,599 --> 00:23:20,920
I won't tell on you either.

412
00:23:21,240 --> 00:23:22,039
What a coincidence.

413
00:23:23,000 --> 00:23:24,640
I also like kneeling in prayer.

414
00:23:25,119 --> 00:23:27,119
I usually like to ask Buddha

415
00:23:27,119 --> 00:23:28,680
for fairness and justice.

416
00:23:28,839 --> 00:23:30,480
May the good be rewarded,

417
00:23:30,680 --> 00:23:32,079
and the evil get what they deserve.

418
00:23:41,599 --> 00:23:42,880
This little act of yours

419
00:23:43,799 --> 00:23:45,400
is much better than the melodrama

420
00:23:45,400 --> 00:23:47,039
you put on for everyone earlier.

421
00:23:47,759 --> 00:23:49,240
At least it feels genuine.

422
00:23:51,480 --> 00:23:53,319
Your family is full of big shots.

423
00:23:54,240 --> 00:23:55,039
Like you,

424
00:23:55,440 --> 00:23:56,880
and my stepmother,

425
00:23:57,720 --> 00:23:59,519
you're the real Oscar winners.

426
00:24:00,279 --> 00:24:01,960
My acting skills can't compare.

427
00:24:11,599 --> 00:24:13,119
You aren't even in the Cheng family yet,

428
00:24:13,839 --> 00:24:16,039
yet you already know it inside out.

429
00:24:16,279 --> 00:24:17,640
People who don't know might think

430
00:24:18,480 --> 00:24:20,319
you've lived with the Chengs for ages.

431
00:24:23,880 --> 00:24:25,240
You never know.

432
00:24:37,839 --> 00:24:38,680
Based on the DNA test,

433
00:24:39,079 --> 00:24:41,359
the subjects' genetic markers match.

434
00:24:41,480 --> 00:24:42,440
The result confirms

435
00:24:42,599 --> 00:24:43,839
that Mr. Cheng Feng

436
00:24:43,880 --> 00:24:46,480
is the biological father of Ms. Sang Luo.

437
00:24:57,240 --> 00:24:58,039
Impossible.

438
00:24:58,200 --> 00:24:59,160
Run the test again!

439
00:24:59,160 --> 00:25:00,119
Check it again!

440
00:25:00,480 --> 00:25:02,160
She can't be my brother's child.

441
00:25:02,160 --> 00:25:03,480
She's definitely a fraud.

442
00:25:04,119 --> 00:25:04,880
Auntie,

443
00:25:06,039 --> 00:25:07,079
without any proof,

444
00:25:07,079 --> 00:25:08,599
you can can't just say things like that.

445
00:25:08,599 --> 00:25:09,960
Don't call me Auntie.

446
00:25:10,640 --> 00:25:11,319
Cheng Ruolin.

447
00:25:11,319 --> 00:25:12,519
Look at the mess you've made.

448
00:25:12,599 --> 00:25:13,480
What was wrong with red wine?

449
00:25:13,480 --> 00:25:14,480
Did you have to use champagne?

450
00:25:15,319 --> 00:25:16,119
Enough.

451
00:25:17,319 --> 00:25:18,119
Doctor,

452
00:25:20,440 --> 00:25:21,720
did you make a mistake?

453
00:25:22,279 --> 00:25:23,319
Do you remember...

454
00:25:23,680 --> 00:25:24,480
yesterday...

455
00:25:24,920 --> 00:25:25,880
yesterday...

456
00:25:26,720 --> 00:25:27,519
Ms. Cheng,

457
00:25:27,640 --> 00:25:28,880
are you sure you want me to say

458
00:25:28,880 --> 00:25:30,240
what happened yesterday?

459
00:25:33,319 --> 00:25:34,119
Yesterday,

460
00:25:34,400 --> 00:25:36,559
you did slip me a bank card

461
00:25:36,680 --> 00:25:38,319
and told me to forge this test.

462
00:25:44,480 --> 00:25:45,480
Cheng Ruolin!

463
00:25:45,839 --> 00:25:47,319
Are you done making a scene?

464
00:25:52,960 --> 00:25:53,640
I...

465
00:25:53,640 --> 00:25:54,559
Oh, Cheng Ruolin.

466
00:25:55,440 --> 00:25:56,720
Look at what you've done.

467
00:25:56,720 --> 00:25:58,039
I don't even have the energy to scold you.

468
00:25:58,039 --> 00:26:00,240
I'm not the only one who doesn't want her!

469
00:26:00,359 --> 00:26:01,519
Now that things went wrong,

470
00:26:02,119 --> 00:26:03,880
you're all blaming me?

471
00:26:05,119 --> 00:26:06,119
Let me tell you,

472
00:26:06,799 --> 00:26:08,680
even if you are my brother's child,

473
00:26:09,359 --> 00:26:11,640
no one in the Cheng family welcomes you.

474
00:26:14,319 --> 00:26:15,119
Cheng Yan,

475
00:26:15,759 --> 00:26:16,720
are you okay with this?

476
00:26:18,319 --> 00:26:19,119
I...

477
00:26:19,119 --> 00:26:20,119
I'll listen to Mom.

478
00:26:20,559 --> 00:26:21,519
Lin Wanmei,

479
00:26:22,680 --> 00:26:23,880
are you okay with this?

480
00:26:27,400 --> 00:26:28,200
Cheng An,

481
00:26:28,640 --> 00:26:29,559
are you okay with this?

482
00:26:32,400 --> 00:26:33,319
I am.

483
00:26:35,440 --> 00:26:36,200
Mom,

484
00:26:36,200 --> 00:26:37,079
are you willing to accept this bastard...

485
00:26:37,079 --> 00:26:37,720
Enough.

486
00:26:38,880 --> 00:26:39,880
Stop talking.

487
00:26:40,200 --> 00:26:41,720
Since her identity is confirmed,

488
00:26:42,200 --> 00:26:43,119
then Sang Luo

489
00:26:43,680 --> 00:26:45,200
is our Cheng family's

490
00:26:45,359 --> 00:26:46,519
granddaughter.

491
00:26:47,279 --> 00:26:48,960
Starting today, she moves into our house.

492
00:26:50,160 --> 00:26:52,079
No one is allowed to object.

493
00:28:10,759 --> 00:28:12,640
I didn't expect Little Uncle to like roses.

494
00:28:12,640 --> 00:28:14,279
Such a tacky flower.

495
00:28:14,480 --> 00:28:15,440
A rose has thorns.

496
00:28:15,920 --> 00:28:16,720
But

497
00:28:17,319 --> 00:28:18,839
it's just for self-defense.

498
00:28:20,119 --> 00:28:21,400
In truth, it's very lonely.

499
00:28:23,519 --> 00:28:24,960
It's just promiscuous.

500
00:28:26,160 --> 00:28:27,680
A flower like this isn't worth keeping.

501
00:28:33,640 --> 00:28:34,839
Disgusting.

502
00:28:48,480 --> 00:28:50,359
Whatever your purpose is for coming here,

503
00:28:51,160 --> 00:28:52,680
stay away from my flowers.

504
00:28:54,799 --> 00:28:56,240
If you don't like it, deal with it.

505
00:29:01,480 --> 00:29:03,160
I may not know what your purpose is,

506
00:29:06,799 --> 00:29:07,839
but I do know this...

507
00:29:09,279 --> 00:29:10,400
You're not Sang Luo.

508
00:29:21,640 --> 00:29:23,960
On Ye Xiaowei using a banned substance,

509
00:29:24,119 --> 00:29:25,720
Valley Breeze Group knew nothing about it.

510
00:29:26,119 --> 00:29:28,279
But as an employee of Valley Breeze Group,

511
00:29:28,440 --> 00:29:29,720
for the mistakes she made,

512
00:29:29,880 --> 00:29:31,640
we naturally won't evade responsibility.

513
00:29:32,799 --> 00:29:34,839
All losses from this Wine Competition

514
00:29:34,839 --> 00:29:35,799
will be covered by us,

515
00:29:35,839 --> 00:29:36,799
Look at her.

516
00:29:36,799 --> 00:29:38,400
including the judges' medical bills

517
00:29:38,400 --> 00:29:39,200
and emotional distress compensation.

518
00:29:39,200 --> 00:29:40,359
Eat! Hurry up and eat it!

519
00:29:40,960 --> 00:29:41,519
Eat it all.

520
00:29:41,519 --> 00:29:42,000
Finish every bite.

521
00:29:43,240 --> 00:29:44,279
If you want revenge,

522
00:29:44,440 --> 00:29:45,480
you know who to look for.

523
00:29:45,920 --> 00:29:47,160
As her supervisor,

524
00:29:47,400 --> 00:29:49,440
I personally apologize to you all.

525
00:29:49,440 --> 00:29:50,319
I'm sorry.

526
00:29:50,319 --> 00:29:51,200
Look how pathetic she is.

527
00:29:51,759 --> 00:29:53,240
It's all due to my lack of oversight.

528
00:29:53,240 --> 00:29:54,240
Look at the way she's eating.

529
00:29:54,240 --> 00:29:56,480
I hope everyone gives her another chance.

530
00:30:04,319 --> 00:30:05,359
Cheng An.

531
00:30:06,720 --> 00:30:07,759
Cheng An!

532
00:30:23,440 --> 00:30:24,680
You saw it all.

533
00:30:25,079 --> 00:30:27,519
Someone told me to take good care of you.

534
00:30:49,759 --> 00:30:50,519
Go on.

535
00:30:51,039 --> 00:30:51,960
Go claim

536
00:30:52,359 --> 00:30:53,759
your glory.

537
00:30:56,079 --> 00:30:57,960
A lowly bastard like you

538
00:30:58,519 --> 00:31:00,279
dares to covet my Cheng An?

539
00:31:01,839 --> 00:31:04,200
Today, I'll teach you one final lesson.

540
00:31:04,759 --> 00:31:06,119
Go to hell!
